    Zoho SMTP email, real signup verification, SmartScholar identity
    
    Email
    - Replace Resend with Zoho Mail over SMTP (nodemailer, pooled connection)
    - scripts/test-email.mjs rewritten as a dependency-free SMTP client
    
    Auth
    - Signup now issues a real verification link instead of auto-confirming
      every address. generateLink + a server-side /auth/confirm that exchanges
      the token hash, so students land signed in rather than being sent to log
      in again.
    - Resend-verification endpoint with a cooldown, wired into login and verify
    - Middleware: send signed-in users to the dashboard, block unverified
      accounts, and fix a branch that was unreachable behind an early return
    
    Brand
    - New logo (S drawn as a road) with generated favicon, app icons, mono and
      lockup, all derived from one source SVG by scripts/build-brand.mjs
    - BRAND-IDENTITY.md and a 10-page brand guidelines PDF
    - Launch film re-rendered: the road draws itself in the logo reveal
    
    Fixes
    - Auth error boxes used danger-50/success-200, which do not exist in the
      Tailwind config and rendered as nothing
    - Frame renderer writes atomically; a truncated PNG had silently produced
      a 7-second video that reported itself as 59 seconds

